.TH CURSEDAP 1 "October 2026" "cursedap 1.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cursedap \- ncurses audio player with waveform, spectrum and pitch classes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cursedap
.I audio_file
.RI [ chunk_size ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Plays WAV, MP3 and FLAC files in a green/red terminal console. Waveform,
FFT spectrum and octave-folded CQT pitch classes are displayed together.
Playback starts paused. A terminal of at least 80 columns by 24 rows is required.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I chunk_size
Processing and FFT size: a power of two from 64 to 1048576 (default 1024).
.SH CONTROLS
Space toggles playback. Left or b and Right or f seek ten seconds.
Up, + or = raises volume; Down or - lowers it. m toggles mute.
Home and End seek to the start and end. q or Escape quits.
Mouse clicks operate buttons and progress bars. Click text and use [ or ] to scroll.
